 noa'i\n- Cody Rhodes\n- Jason Momoa\n- Eric André\n- 50 Cent\n- Don Lee\n
 - Mel Jarnson\n\n\nEn 1993\, Ryu et Ken Masters\, deux Street Fighters aut
